  "packaging_boundary": "Version 1.2.1 adds native-skill packaging only. The functional freshness checker remains v1.2, and the resolver and handoff-card base components remain the unchanged already-public Yumi continuity v1.1 capability. The freshness checker packages and reuses those base components; it is not independent validation. Immutable base code metadata may retain the earlier noqt/noqt origin documentation URL.",
