  "claim_boundary": "READY means required-key consistency only within the supplied ledger. UNCHANGED means the supplied ready card snapshot matches a newly resolved supplied ledger; card digest claims remain unauthenticated. No result establishes truth, authenticated provenance, ledger freshness or completeness, permission, safety, task completion, intelligence, adoption, or savings."
